msgid "## 5 Online Service Deployment {: #5-online-service-deployment }"
msgstr "## 5 在线服务部署 {: #5-online-service-deployment }"

msgid "### 5.1 Single-Node Online Deployment"
msgstr "### 5.1 单节点在线部署"

msgid ""
"For single-node online deployment on Atlas 800 A3, the following DP1 × TP8 "
"command was validated with an Ascend-compatible W8A8 checkpoint. It enables "
"QSA Lightning Indexer, QSA Expand E3, MTP speculative decoding, Function "
"Calling, and reasoning parsing."
msgstr ""
"对于 Atlas 800 A3 上的单节点在线部署，以下 DP1 × TP8 命令已使用 Ascend 兼容的 W8A8 权重完成验证。该命令启用了 "
"QSA Lightning Indexer、QSA Expand E3、MTP 投机解码、Function Calling 和推理解析。"

msgid "Before starting the service:"
msgstr "启动服务之前："

msgid ""
"- Replace `MODEL_PATH` with the directory recorded when downloading the model weight.\n"
"- Revalidate memory capacity before changing the context length, concurrency, or memory utilization."
msgstr ""
"- 将 `MODEL_PATH` 替换为下载模型权重时记录的目录。\n"
"- 在更改上下文长度、并发量或内存利用率之前，请重新验证内存容量。"

msgid "=== \"A3 series\""
msgstr "=== \"A3 系列\""

msgid "The following example is for Atlas 800 A3."
msgstr "以下示例适用于 Atlas 800 A3。"

msgid "Key parameter descriptions:"
msgstr "关键参数说明："

msgid ""
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_QSA_LIGHTNING_INDEXER=1` enables the fused QSA Lightning Indexer path.\n"
"    - `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_QSA_E3V=1` enables the fused QSA Expand E3 path.\n"
"    - `--quantization ascend` loads the Ascend-compatible W8A8 checkpoint.\n"
"    - `--tensor-parallel-size 8` and `--data-parallel-size 1` configure the A3 single-DP TP8 topology.\n"
"    - `--enable-expert-parallel` enables expert parallelism for the MoE layers.\n"
"    - `--enable-prefix-caching --mamba-cache-mode align` enables Prefix Caching with aligned GDN and PLE state checkpoints.\n"
"    - The validated command does not set `--language-model-only`, so the vision encoder remains enabled and the service accepts both text and multimodal requests. For a text-only deployment, you may add `--language-model-only` to skip loading the vision encoder.\n"
"    - `--enable-auto-tool-choice --tool-call-parser qwen3_xml` enables automatic Function Calling with the Qwen3 XML parser.\n"
"    - `--reasoning-parser qwen3` separates reasoning from the final answer in the OpenAI-compatible response.\n"
"    - `--speculative-config` uses the model's MTP head to draft three tokens. `enforce_eager=true` keeps the MTP proposer in eager mode.\n"
"    - `--compilation-config` enables `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` ACLGraph for decode.\n"
"    - `fuse_norm_quant=false` selects the validated norm and quantization path for this W8A8 deployment."
msgstr ""
"- `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_QSA_LIGHTNING_INDEXER=1` 启用融合的 QSA Lightning Indexer 路径。\n"
"    - `VLLM_ASCEND_ENABLE_QSA_E3V=1` 启用融合的 QSA Expand E3 路径。\n"
"    - `--quantization ascend` 加载 Ascend 兼容的 W8A8 权重。\n"
"    - `--tensor-parallel-size 8` 和 `--data-parallel-size 1` 配置 A3 单 DP TP8 拓扑。\n"
"    - `--enable-expert-parallel` 为 MoE 层启用专家并行。\n"
"    - `--enable-prefix-caching --mamba-cache-mode align` 启用前缀缓存，并对齐 GDN 和 PLE 状态检查点。\n"
"    - 已验证的命令未设置 `--language-model-only`，因此视觉编码器保持启用，服务同时接受文本和多模态请求。对于纯文本部署，可以添加 `--language-model-only` 以跳过加载视觉编码器。\n"
"    - `--enable-auto-tool-choice --tool-call-parser qwen3_xml` 使用 Qwen3 XML 解析器启用自动 Function Calling。\n"
"    - `--reasoning-parser qwen3` 在 OpenAI 兼容响应中将推理过程与最终答案分离。\n"
"    - `--speculative-config` 使用模型的 MTP 头草拟三个 token。`enforce_eager=true` 使 MTP 提议器保持 eager 模式。\n"
"    - `--compilation-config` 为 decode 启用 `FULL_DECODE_ONLY` ACLGraph。\n"
"    - `fuse_norm_quant=false` 为此 W8A8 部署选择已验证的 norm 和量化路径。"

msgid "## 6 Functional Verification"
msgstr "## 6 功能验证"

msgid ""
"After the service is started, the model can be invoked by sending a prompt. "
"The `chat/completions` API is supported. Use the `--served-model-name` you "
"configured (`qwen3.8-flash-next` for `Qwen3.8-Flash-Next`)."
msgstr ""
"服务启动后，可以通过发送提示词来调用模型。支持 `chat/completions` API。请使用您配置的 `--served-model-"
"name`（对于 `Qwen3.8-Flash-Next` 为 `qwen3.8-flash-next`）。"

msgid "### 6.1 Basic Chat Completion"
msgstr "### 6.1 基础对话补全"

msgid "Expected result: the service returns HTTP 200 OK."
msgstr "预期结果：服务返回 HTTP 200 OK。"

msgid "### 6.2 Multimodal Chat Completion"
msgstr "### 6.2 多模态对话补全"

msgid ""
"The validated deployment accepts image-and-text input. Replace `<IMAGE_URL>`"
" with an image URL accessible from the serving environment:"
msgstr "已验证的部署接受图文输入。将 `<IMAGE_URL>` 替换为服务环境可访问的图片 URL："

msgid ""
"Expected result: the service returns HTTP 200 OK and describes the supplied "
"image in `choices[0].message.content`."
msgstr "预期结果：服务返回 HTTP 200 OK，并在 `choices[0].message.content` 中描述所提供的图片。"

msgid "### 6.3 Function Calling"
msgstr "### 6.3 函数调用"

msgid ""
"Function Calling requires the following startup options, which are already "
"included in Section 5:"
msgstr "函数调用需要以下启动选项，这些选项已包含在第 5 节中："

msgid ""
"Send a request containing the available tools and set `tool_choice` to "
"`auto`:"
msgstr "发送包含可用工具的请求，并将 `tool_choice` 设置为 `auto`："

msgid ""
"When the model chooses the function, the parsed result appears in "
"`choices[0].message.tool_calls`. The caller must execute the function and "
"send its result back to the model in a follow-up message."
msgstr ""
"当模型选择该函数时，解析结果会出现在 `choices[0].message.tool_calls` "
"中。调用方必须执行该函数，并在后续消息中将结果发送回模型。"

msgid "### 6.4 Reasoning Parser and Thinking Control"
msgstr "### 6.4 推理解析器与思考控制"

msgid ""
"Reasoning parsing requires the following startup option, which is already "
"included in Section 5:"
msgstr "推理解析需要以下启动选项，该选项已包含在第 5 节中："

msgid ""
"Qwen3.8-Flash-Next uses thinking mode by default. To request reasoning "
"explicitly, set `enable_thinking` to `true` (or omit it). The parser returns"
" the reasoning separately from the final answer:"
msgstr ""
"Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 默认使用思考模式。要显式请求推理，请将 `enable_thinking` 设置为 "
"`true`（或省略该参数）。解析器会将推理内容与最终答案分开返回："

msgid ""
"The final answer is returned in `choices[0].message.content`, while the "
"parsed reasoning is returned separately in the reasoning field of the "
"response."
msgstr ""
"最终答案在 `choices[0].message.content` 中返回，而解析出的推理内容则在响应的 reasoning 字段中单独返回。"

msgid ""
